{"lyrics":"[00:01.54] I had a dream you left me\n[00:15.00] I had a dream\n[00:15.74] I had a dream you left me, I woke up scared to death\n[00:21.12] 'Cause I won't have nothing left if you leave\n[00:28.54] I had a dream you left, I woke up scared to death\n[00:34.78] 'Cause I won't have nothing left, you're my everything\n[00:41.18] It's funny when they tell me I'm a sad boy\n[00:44.52] Bitch, what you think I'm using all the drugs for?\n[00:47.72] Wreck the Benz truck while listenin' to “Benz Truck“, ha, I won't be sad no more (Sad)\n[00:54.88] Somewhere down the line I meet a sad girl, next thing you know she in my bed\n[01:01.66] Next thing you know she in my world, next thing you know she in my head\n[01:08.20] Let's add a little drama to the scene (Drama), this is where I tell you that I love you when you leave (Love you)\n[01:14.34] This is where you tell me that I don't mean anything (Nothing)\n[01:17.74] Then that's when I tell you that you were my everything (Everything)\n[01:22.62] I had a dream you left me, I woke up scared to death\n[01:28.48] 'Cause I won't have nothing left if you leave\n[01:36.16] I had a dream you left, I woke up scared to death\n[01:42.00] 'Cause I won't have nothing left, you're my everything\n[01:48.62] If I drive off the bridge, baby, burn it after me (Oh-oh-oh)\n[01:52.36] Maybe you would die too, double casualty\n[01:55.82] I been getting high too, high for sanity (Oh, oh-oh-oh), Codeine crazy (Ooh)\n[02:02.58] On the brighter side of things, I think that you're amazing (Ooh-oj=h)\n[02:05.94] If I die before you, baby, will you bring me daisies? (Ooh)\n[02:09.32] Always in my bed, no, it's not because I'm lazy\n[02:12.28] It's 'cause I'm in my head fucking hyperventilating\n[02:16.00] Girl, you know you make me (Oh, oh-oh-oh)\n[02:17.68] You tell me to shut up, I tell you to make me\n[02:21.06] Then we get to fuckin', legs get to shaking (Oh-oh-oh)\n[02:24.70] Watch if you leave how my heart get to breaking\n[02:30.22] I had